{"id":"544fe7d3-b61d-413a-bb5b-18e947abef27","type":"https://serlo.org/editor","variant":"serlo-org","domainOrigin":"serlo.org","version":2,"editorVersion":"0.22.0","dateModified":"2025-02-26T18:21:29.676Z","document":{"plugin":"exercise","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Ein kreisförmiger Teller besitzt einen Durchmesser von 30 cm. Berechne den Flächeninhalt des Tellers. Runde das Ergebnis auf ganze Zahlen."}]}],"id":"529453cd-86ee-4d4d-b065-22deae40fa83"}],"id":"0f0b05da-a4c5-4b4b-abb8-d38f0d7f7333"},"solution":{"plugin":"solution","state":{"prerequisite":{"id":"1553","title":"Kreis"},"strategy":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{}]}],"id":"000b137e-32e6-4c15-8aff-f1eb90ae953f"},"steps":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Der Teller besitzt die Form eines Kreises. Somit kann der Flächeninhalt des Tellers mithilfe der Formel für den Kreisflächeninhalt berechnet werden:"}]}],"id":"9c3a7c71-7c90-4482-a61e-7421fd25d779"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"A = \pi r^2","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"900a78a8-0072-4dd1-8e12-0ad88394639e"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Da in der Aufgabenstellung der Durchmesser "},{"type":"math","src":"d ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"d","em":true}]},{"text":" ","em":true},{"text":"gegeben ist, musst du zuerst den Radius "},{"type":"math","src":"r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"r","em":true}]},{"text":" daraus berechnen."}]}],"id":"886c1f1a-a064-4753-96fc-cd48bad32d8c"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl} 
d = 2r \Rightarrow r &=& \dfrac{d}{2} \\\\
r &=& \dfrac{30\,\mathrm{cm}}{2} \\\\
r &=& 15 \,\mathrm{cm}
\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"3a8fee03-e2e6-4454-bd9c-5d3f70a60346"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Diesen Wert kannst du nun in die Formel einsetzen und den Flächeninhalt berechnen."}]}],"id":"0463aa04-df90-49f1-91b9-c11c5b605dcc"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}  
A &=& \pi r^2 \\
A &=& \pi \cdot (15 \,\mathrm{cm})^2 \\
A &=& \pi \cdot 225 \,\mathrm{cm^2} \approx 707 \,\mathrm{cm^2}
  \end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"06e5d9de-5b4e-4f6a-8ce0-c706e9672ca0"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Daraus folgt, dass der Teller einen Flächeninhalt von ca. "},{"type":"math","src":"707 \,\mathrm{cm^2}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" besitzt."}]}],"id":"a790a420-d873-4df4-9b0d-de8af0702d3b"}],"id":"a6abb6c3-c465-4d4d-94b9-565aa7418ec0"}},"id":"e538278d-5667-465c-bad6-0dd5032befb3"}},"id":"f3ddf1cc-1201-47e6-879e-bf46be13bc7f"}}
